Question: List all clients with diamond cards in Prague.
Gold SQL: SELECT T1.client_id FROM client AS T1 JOIN district AS T2 ON T1.district_id = T2.district_id JOIN disp AS T3 ON T1.client_id = T3.client_id JOIN card AS T4 ON T3.disp_id = T4.disp_id WHERE T2.name = 'Prague' AND T4.type = 'diamond'
